# @name: openssl | Encrypt File with AES
# @description: Encrypts a file using AES-256-CBC Group: Encryption and Decryption. Template: replace placeholders before running. {input_file} = Input file to encrypt [default "input.txt"] | {output_file} = Output encrypted file [default "output.enc"]
openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -in {input_file} -out {output_file}